en a 'Investigate Abuse Report' activity must eventually occur after it at some point in the same process instance. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Report Animal Abuse' events can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Investigate Abuse Report' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Report Animal Abuse' events.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Report Animal Abuse\",\"description\":\"The 'Report Animal Abuse' activity represents the initial step of reporting an incident of animal abuse to the organization.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Investigate Abuse Report\",\"description\":\"The 'Investigate Abuse Report' activity involves reviewing and validating the details of a reported animal abuse case.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Report Animal Abuse' activity occurs and the reported Abuse Severity is High, then a 'Rescue Abused Animal' activity must eventually occur after it at some point in the same process instance. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Report Animal Abuse' events can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Rescue Abused Animal' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Report Animal Abuse' events. If 'Report Animal Abuse' does not occur or the Abuse Severity is not High, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Rescue Abused Animal'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Report Animal Abuse\",\"description\":\"The 'Report Animal Abuse' activity represents the initial step of reporting an incident of animal abuse to the organization.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Rescue Abused Animal\",\"description\":\"The 'Rescue Abused Animal' activity represents physically rescuing an animal from an abusive situation.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Abuse Severity is High\",\"correl