al.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Schedule Animal Checkup\",\"description\":\"The 'Schedule Animal Checkup' activity involves planning a follow-up medical checkup for an animal that received veterinary care.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,30,d\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Provide Veterinary Care' activity must be followed by a 'Find Foster Home' activity at some point later in the same process instance. Conversely, a 'Find Foster Home' event can occur only if a 'Provide Veterinary Care' event has occurred before it within the same process instance. This bidirectional and ordered dependency ensures that 'Provide Veterinary Care' imposes obligations for future 'Find Foster Home', and 'Find Foster Home' cannot occur without prior 'Provide Veterinary Care'. Multiple 'Provide Veterinary Care' and 'Find Foster Home' events are allowed, with each 'Provide Veterinary Care' eventually leading to a 'Find Foster Home' and each 'Find Foster Home' being justified by a preceding 'Provide Veterinary Care'.\",\"template\":\"Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Provide Veterinary Care\",\"description\":\"The 'Provide Veterinary Care' activity involves delivering medical treatment to a rescued animal.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Find Foster Home\",\"description\":\"The 'Find Foster Home' activity represents locating and arranging a foster home for an animal that has cleared veterinary care.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Conduct Adoption Screening' activity must be followed by a 'Finalize Animal Adoption' activity at some point later in the same process instance. Conversely, a 'Finalize Animal Adoption' event can occur only if a 'Conduct Adoption Screening' event has occurred before it within the same process instance. This bidirectional and ordered dependency ensures that 'Conduct Adoption Screening' imposes obligations for future 'Finalize Animal Adoption', and 'Finalize Animal Adoption' cannot occur without prior 'Conduct Adoption Screening'. Multiple 'Conduct Adoption Screening' and 'Finalize Animal Adoption' events are allowed.\",\"template\":\"Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Conduct Adoption Screening\",\"description\":\"The 'Conduct Adoption Screening' activity involves evaluating and screening potential adopters for an animal.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Finalize Animal Adoption\",\"description\":\"The 'Finalize Animal Adoption' activity represents completing the formal adoption process for an animal.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Conduct Adoption Screening' activity occurs and the Adoption Status is Approved, then a 'Finalize Animal Adoption' activity must eventually occur after it at some point in the same process instance. The 'Finalize Animal Adoption' must occur within 7 days of the 'Conduct Adoption Screening' event. Multiple 'Conduct Adoption Screening' events can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Finalize Animal Adoption' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Conduct Adoption Screening' events.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Conduct Adoption Screening\",\"description\":\"The 'Conduct Adoption Screening' activity involves evaluating and screening potential adopters for an animal.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Finalize Animal Adoption\",\"description\":\"The 'Finalize Animal Adoption' activity represents completing the formal adoption process for an animal.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Adoption Status is Approved\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,7,d\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Finalize Animal Adoption' activity must be followed by a 'Monitor Animal Welfare' activity at some point later in the sam